# Line-ending policy (repository stores LF; checkout EOL is defined here, not by core.autocrlf):
# - Windows/.NET-native files: CRLF in the working tree (default).
# - Cross-platform scripts, docs, and tool configs used from Git Bash/WSL/CI: LF.
# - Binary assets: never converted.
# Keep .editorconfig end_of_line settings in sync with this file.

* text=auto eol=crlf

# Windows-native
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Cross-platform (LF)
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
uv.lock text eol=lf
.yamllint text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf

# Binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.rslib binary
*.rspak binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.pdb binary
*.nupkg binary
*.snupkg binary
